								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/bullshit.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=KebenerLone&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="KebenerLone" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=754"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.unionofpower.org" title="Union of Power" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1014.msg10245#msg10245"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1014.msg10245#msg10245">Re: Guess that Guild</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #26 on:</b> August 19, 2004, 12:59:10 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I wasn&#039;t pointing a finger at you saltar.&nbsp; Why jump at the chance to defend yourself?<br /><br />I didn&#039;t have too much of a problem with you or your partner in crime.&nbsp; You guys are gone and doing something else, it&#039;s a done deal.<br /><br />As far as Grem &quot;taking&quot; people from UoP, I think you are mistaken.&nbsp; Victori was gone from UoP long before you got her to be a mule for ascent.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Elder Olidus Mashern<br />65th Prophet of Rallos Zek<br />Member of [Union of Power]
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
